# Complete declaration bytes accompany the extracted semantic fields.
grammar c_sharp
records children
node @record group as packaging capture source
node class_declaration group as class_declaration capture source
node struct_declaration group as struct_declaration capture source
node method_declaration group as method_declaration capture source
node constructor_declaration group as constructor_declaration capture source
node record_declaration group as record_declaration capture source
node property_declaration group as property_declaration capture source
node interface_declaration group as interface_declaration capture source
node enum_declaration group as enum_declaration capture source
node delegate_declaration group as delegate_declaration capture source
node identifier text field name under class_declaration as name
node identifier text field name under struct_declaration as name
node identifier text field name under method_declaration as name
node identifier text field name under constructor_declaration as name
node identifier text field name under record_declaration as name
node identifier text field name under property_declaration as name
node identifier text field name under interface_declaration as name
node identifier text field name under enum_declaration as name
node identifier text field name under delegate_declaration as name
node parameter_list text as parameters
node block text as implementation
node arrow_expression_clause text as implementation

